{
  "id": "str-str",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "title": "查找日志片段首次出现位置",
  "descriptionLines": [
    "给定两个字符串 haystack 和 needle，请返回 needle 在 haystack 中第一次出现的下标；如果 needle 不是 haystack 的子串则返回 -1。",
    "",
    "要求：",
    "1. 当 needle 为空字符串时返回 0。",
    "2. 请自行实现匹配逻辑，不要直接调用语言内置的查找函数。",
    "",
    "函数签名：strStr(haystack, needle)",
    "返回值示例：haystack = 'hello', needle = 'll' 时返回 2"
  ],
  "functionName": "strStr",
  "paramNames": [
    "haystack",
    "needle"
  ],
  "approachExplanation": "朴素双指针匹配：枚举 haystack 中每个可能的起点 i（满足 i + needle 长度不超过 haystack 长度），从该起点逐字符与 needle 比对，全部匹配即返回 i。最坏时间复杂度 O(n*m)，对本题规模足够；面试中可以进一步聊 KMP 如何把复杂度降到 O(n+m)。",
  "referenceSolutionLines": [
    "function strStr(haystack, needle) {",
    "  if (needle.length === 0) return 0;",
    "  const n = haystack.length;",
    "  const m = needle.length;",
    "  for (let i = 0; i + m <= n; i++) {",
    "    let ok = true;",
    "    for (let j = 0; j < m; j++) {",
    "      if (haystack[i + j] !== needle[j]) {",
    "        ok = false;",
    "        break;",
    "      }",
    "    }",
    "    if (ok) return i;",
    "  }",
    "  return -1;",
    "}"
  ],
  "expectedOutputs": [
    0,
    -1,
    2,
    0,
    0,
    -1
  ],
  "testInputs": [
    {
      "input": [
        "sadbutsad",
        "sad"
      ],
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "input": [
        "leetcode",
        "leeto"
      ],
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "input": [
        "hello",
        "ll"
      ],
      "hidden": true
    },
